es.com/contest/403/problem/D"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"403D - Beautiful Pairs of Numbers"}],"kind":"link"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"First, we can note, that length of sequence is not greater then 50. Ok, but why? Because all numbers "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"b"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":" - "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":" are different, so 0 + 1 + ... + 50 > 1000. Let's imagine, that sequence from input is a sequence of non-intersecting segments. So, "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"c"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":" = "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"b"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":" - "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"}],"kind":"subscript"},{"kind":"text","text":" + 1 is length of segment "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":". Also, "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/editorial-assets/801ed27a691ed597ff8b3703496e453d8fa0f900980a38ec9d64eeab83fbfa7c.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". After that let's calculate the following DP: "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"d"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"]["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"j"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"]["},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"k"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"] — — number